{"seq":1,"slug":"ir-fundamentals","title":"事件响应基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/ir-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ir-lifecycle","title":"事件响应生命周期与框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/ir-fundamentals/ir-lifecycle","wordCount":2729,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"ir-team-building","title":"安全响应团队建设与能力矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/ir-fundamentals/ir-team-building","wordCount":2484,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"incident-classification","title":"安全事件分类与分级体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/ir-fundamentals/incident-classification","wordCount":2758,"readingTime":12}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"事件响应基础\">事件响应基础</h1><p>本章建立安全事件响应的理论框架与组织基础。首先介绍 NIST、SANS 等主流事件响应生命周期模型及其演进，为后续实操章节提供方法论支撑。然后探讨安全响应团队（CSIRT/CERT）的组建模式、角色分工与能力矩阵建设。最后建立安全事件的分类分级体系，确保不同严重程度的事件得到对应级别的响应资源投入。</p>\n"}